# Test files must NEVER be deployed. Vercel turns every file under api/ into a
# Serverless Function, so *.test.ts counted against the Hobby plan's hard cap of
# 12 functions/deployment (6 test files = 6 wasted slots). Excluding them here
# keeps the deployed count = real functions only. Guarded by api/deploy-budget.test.ts.
*.test.ts
*.test.js
# vitest snapshots sit beside the FE suites under public/, the static deploy root.
__snapshots__/
